    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.4388427734375,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "newer medicines (e.g. sequencing) are critical (and in the case of DST, necessary) accompaniments",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        322.0972900390625,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "to the treatment recommendations in these guidelines.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        203.19862365722656,
        527.4122314453125,
        217.64161682128906
      ],
      "text": "Patients on longer MDR-TB treatment regimens need to be monitored for treatment response and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        215.1226348876953,
        527.4168701171875,
        230.8416290283203
      ],
      "text": "(15, 65) for safety, using reasonable schedules of relevant clinical and laboratory testing  . Response",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        229.59864807128906,
        527.4322509765625,
        244.04164123535156
      ],
      "text": "to treatment and toxicity are monitored through regular history-taking, physical examination and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        242.79859924316406,
        527.4234008789062,
        257.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "chest radiography; special tests such as audiometry, visual acuity tests and electrocardiography; and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.9987335205078,
        527.433349609375,
        270.4417419433594
      ],
      "text": "laboratory monitoring. Using smear microscopy or culture to assess conversion of bacteriological",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.1986083984375,
        527.4256591796875,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "status is an important way to assess response, and most patients are expected to have converted",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        527.4443359375,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "to a sputum-negative status within the first few months of starting treatment. Persistence of culture",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.5986328125,
        527.5925903320312,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "positivity beyond that point, or close to the expected end of the intensive phase when injectable agents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95139217376709,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        308.798583984375,
        527.4224243164062,
        323.2416076660156
      ],
      "text": "are in use, should trigger a review of the regimen and performance of DST. NTPs should also aim for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.99859619140625,
        527.4365844726562,
        336.4416198730469
      ],
      "text": "complete registration of patients with MDR/RR-TB, through follow-up and monitoring of treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        335.1986083984375,
        514.9945068359375,
        349.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "outcomes as part of national surveillance. Regular review of MDR/RR-TB cohort data is essential.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
