      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        409.7025146484375,
        524.2453002929688,
        424.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "by the increasing use worldwide of combinations of new and repurposed medications in MDR/",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
